{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "说一不二的行事风格  (He Means Every Word)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 9 of Behind the Scenes. After turning away an angry network executive who came looking for Chun Yuqiao, Bu Xiaogu praises Xingzi's foresight in the Chief Editor's Office. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "多亏咱们提前做好了准备，杏子姐，还是你有经验。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这种经验在老大身边，已经不是一次两次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "每次抛出来一个新的东西，就是各方最炸毛的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这个时候，能不让老大见他们就别见，不然会打起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总还会打架呢？他这么暴躁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他不暴躁，他只是说一不二。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是说一不二呢，就会让别人暴躁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以前我一直以为，淳于总是个独断专行的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但前天那会上，他大力支持咱们的方案，我一下子就懂了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他对咱们的信任，真的超出咱们的想象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在工作上呢，确实从来都不独断。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "多亏咱们提前做好了准备，杏子姐，还是你有经验。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thankfully we prepared in advance, Xingzi; you really have experience.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这种经验在老大身边，已经不是一次两次了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Working beside the boss, I have been through this more than once or twice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "每次抛出来一个新的东西，就是各方最炸毛的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever he rolls out something new, that is when every side bristles the most.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这个时候，能不让老大见他们就别见，不然会打起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At times like this, keep the boss from meeting them if possible, or a fight will break out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总还会打架呢？他这么暴躁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao even gets into fights? Is his temper really that fiery?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他不暴躁，他只是说一不二。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is not hot-tempered; he simply means every word he says.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是说一不二呢，就会让别人暴躁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet meaning every word he says drives other people crazy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以前我一直以为，淳于总是个独断专行的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before, I always thought Chun Yuqiao was an autocratic boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但前天那会上，他大力支持咱们的方案，我一下子就懂了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet at the meeting two days ago, when he backed our proposal so strongly, I understood right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他对咱们的信任，真的超出咱们的想象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His trust in us truly goes beyond anything we imagined.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在工作上呢，确实从来都不独断。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When it comes to work, the boss really is never autocratic.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "多亏咱们提前做好了准备，杏子姐，还是你有经验。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这种经验在老大身边，已经不是一次两次了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "每次抛出来一个新的东西，就是各方最炸毛的时候。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这个时候，能不让老大见他们就别见，不然会打起来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总还会打架呢？他这么暴躁啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他不暴躁，他只是说一不二。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "但是说一不二呢，就会让别人暴躁。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以前我一直以为，淳于总是个独断专行的人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但前天那会上，他大力支持咱们的方案，我一下子就懂了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他对咱们的信任，真的超出咱们的想象。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在工作上呢，确实从来都不独断。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xingzi explains that Chun Yuqiao never rules by whim at work, even if his uncompromising standards rattle everyone else. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
